    <Date>2017-05-01</Date>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2017_0112","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Rangi Tanaka talks about the moment before the first mark. The artist insists the recording itself is the artwork and that we are now co-authors.</Description>
